{"id":"P077-2","subject":"P","unit":"P077","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P077-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n단권 변압기의 1차 전압이 165V, 2차 전압이 220V\n\n일 때, 부하용량이 900kVA 인 경우, 단권 변압기의 자\n\n기용량은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n\n① 160         ② 185\n\n③ 200         ④ 215\n\n⑤ 225","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1277}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n극수가 4와 2인 두 대의 3상 유도전동기를 직렬 종속으로\n\n운전할 때의 동기속도는 몇 rps인가?\n\n(단, 주파수는 60Hz이다.)\n\n\n① 1200         ② 900\n\n③ 300         ④ 60\n\n⑤ 20","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1280}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n주파수60Hz, 슬립 4의 3상 유도전동기의 전부하 회\n\n전수가 3456rpm일 때, 유도전동기의 극수는?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8\n\n⑤ 12","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":602}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n다음 사이리스터의 각 단자 명칭은?\n\n\n\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①     Anode         Gate        Cathode\n\n ②      Gate        Cathode       Anode\n\n ③    Cathode       Anode         Gate\n\n ④     Anode       Cathode        Gate\n\n ⑤    Cathode        Gate        Anode","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":694},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":957}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n발열량 5000kcalkg의 석탄 2ton을 사용하여 4500\n\nkWh의 전력을 발생하는 화력발전소의 종합효율은 몇\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 35.2         ② 36.4\n\n③ 38.7         ④ 39.8\n\n⑤ 40.6","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":925}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n다음과 같은 조건의 독립형 태양광 발전용 축전지의 용량은\n\n몇 Ah인가?\n\n ⦁1일 전산부하량  : 72kWh\n ⦁부조일수  : 10일\n ⦁단일 축전지 전압 12V\n\n ⦁축전지의 직렬접속 개수  : 30개\n\n ⦁보수율  : 0.8\n\n\n\n① 1600         ② 1800\n\n③ 2000         ④ 2250\n\n⑤ 2500","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":666},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":818}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n부하에 전력을 공급하기 위한 축전지를 설치하려고 한다.\n\n부하에서 필요한 총 방전 에너지는 2500kWh이며,\n\n축전지의 DoD는 50이다. 이 때, 필요한 축전지의 정\n\n격용량kWh은 얼마인가?\n\n\n① 3000         ② 4000\n\n③ 5000         ④ 6200\n\n⑤ 7800","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":525}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n연축전지의 정격용량 100Ah, 상시부하 10kW, 표준전\n\n압 100V인 부동충전 방식에서, 충전기 2차 전류는 몇\n\nA 인가?\n\n\n① 250         ② 200\n\n③ 160         ④ 150\n\n⑤ 110","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":540},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m33-e2.webp","width":696,"height":375}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\nHVDC변환설비는 전류형이 있고, 전압형이 있다. 그 중에\n\n서 전류형 변환설비의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① Thyristor 변환방식을 사용한다.\n\n② 유효전력과 무효전력의 독립제어가 가능하다.\n\n③ LCC(Line Commutated Convertor)방식을 기반으로 한다.\n\n④ 유효전력의 50~60의 무효전력이 필요하다.\n\n⑤ Point to Point방식으로 활용할 수 있다.","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1509}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n3상 유도 전동기의 속도제어중 VVVF제어방식에서 V/ f\n\n의 비를 일정하게 하는 이유는?\n\n\n① 토크를 일정하게 하기 위해\n\n② 역기전력을 일정하게 하기 위해\n\n③ 전력손실을 감소시키기 위해\n\n④ 출력을 일정하게 하기 위해\n\n⑤ 전압강하를 줄이기 위해","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":396}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n극수 4, 전기자도체수 120, 극당 자속이 0.1인 단중\n파권 직류 발전기의 유도 기전력이 500V일 때, 발전기\n의 회전속도는 몇 rpm인가?\n\n\n① 1000         ② 1250\n\n③ 1500         ④ 1750\n\n⑤ 2500","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m36